{'symbol': 'DAL', 'date': '2022-08-01 07:30:00', 'title': 'DELTA AIR LINES ANNOUNCES EARLY TENDER RESULTS OF, AND ELECTION OF EARLY SETTLEMENT FOR, ITS OFFER FOR OUTSTANDING NOTES', 'text': 'ATLANTA , AUG. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DELTA AIR LINES, INC. (NYSE:DAL) ("DELTA") ANNOUNCED TODAY THE EARLY TENDER PARTICIPATION RESULTS, AS OF 5:00 P.M., NEW YORK CITY TIME, ON JULY 29, 2022 (THE "EARLY TENDER TIME"), OF ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED CASH TENDER OFFER FOR UP TO $1.5 BILLION IN AGGREGATE PURCHASE PRICE, EXCLUDING ACCRUED AND UNPAID INTEREST (THE "MAXIMUM TENDER AMOUNT"), OF CERTAIN OF ITS OUTSTANDING DEBT SECURITIES (THE "NOTES").'}